                <head>No. ——.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hawaiian Islands</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Island of——, District of——, ss:</hi></p>
                <p>I, —— ——, aged——, a native of——, residing at ——, in said district, do solemnly
                    swear, in the presence of Almighty God, that I will support the constitution of
                    the Hawaiian Kingdom, promulgated and proclaimed on the 7th day of July, 1887,
                    and the laws of said Kingdom, not hereby renouncing but expressly reserving all
                    allegiance and citizenship now owing or held by me.</p>
                <p>Subscribed and sworn to before me this—— day of——,A. D. 18–.</p>
                <p>—— ——,</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Inspector of Election.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
